No second vessel, no valves invented from shading, no gauge, thermometer, flame, height scale, pressure or temperature numbers. No text, letters, digits, labels, arrows, axes, dimensions, answer annotations or instructions. No child or cultural costume; no old monochrome archival engraving or book texture.
